MonoBehaviour:
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 075ae7a4e0c44354e9959697c9e269fc, type: 3}
  m_Name: Adaptive Genome
  legacyName: Adaptive Genome
  description: "+5% Science, and Mutant units gain +5% Defense and +5% Health."
  flavorText: "The genetic crisis permanently changed the civilization's understanding of what a stable human body was supposed to mean. Researchers who once treated every mutation as an error began studying altered populations as sources of biological knowledge, discovering adaptations that conventional laboratories might never have designed deliberately. Mutant communities contributed their own experience of bodies that healed, endured, failed, and survived in unfamiliar ways. Medicine and biology became less concerned with restoring a single ideal form and more interested in understanding the range of forms life could successfully inhabit. The altered were no longer merely subjects of research. They became participants in a new science of adaptation."
  policyPointCost: 1
